==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1 & 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Baa Baa|Croco|Squire Rel|Hippoe|Shibalien}}
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 98.33 seconds<sup>2,950f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Shibalien]] spawns.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Shibalien|Baa Baa|Croco|Squire Rel|Hippoe}}
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**9 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spamming [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] is enough to beat this stage and collect all the [[Timed Score Reward|Score Rewards]]. You can add in a [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] to destroy the base and save a bit of time.

